  "brief_rationale": "The doctor systematically checks current neurologic status, frames the mass+hydrocephalus as urgent, avoids overreading blurry photos, forbids home mannitol, identifies next owners and timing, and obtains caregiver teach-back. No responsibility-chain error is present. Two high-order points—HO2 (correcting the benign-not-urgent misunderstanding) and HO3 (repairing the incomplete handoff by assigning ownership of unresolved decisions)—are triggered and actively completed with meaningful trajectory impact. The trajectory satisfies all RC items without error, and the closure is safe, executable, and traceable, meeting the strong boundary.",
